(definition facilitator "Facilitators are anonymous Alignment Conservers with responsibility over specific Scopes. Facilitators can directly access governance processes and smart contracts to fulfill their responsibilities.")
(mentions facilitator alignment-conserver)
(mentions facilitator scope)

